{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Files a new plan item into kb.plan via agent.archivist.remember. The item is stamped work:true (a GENUINE TODO, 2026-10) - the archivist's kb.plan guard admits only work-flagged entries and refuses insight deposits, so this is the todo front-door. Tags plan,proposed, confidence medium, author resolved from the calling session (fallback plan-board). SUB-ITEMS: pass `parent` = the exact claim of another kb.plan entry to file this as a CHILD phase of that parent; a phased plan is filed as N children under a parent claim. PARENT COORDINATION IS THE DEFAULT (2026-11): an accepted parent is itself an executable coordination task - its step_item turn promotes the next child proposed -> accepted (a blocked child only with a written remedy), so children of an accepted parent do NOT need a manual human acceptance each. The parent reports done only after every non-abandoned child is completed/done AND a closing coordination turn has verified the integrated outcome (the old auto-complete-on-last-child rollup was removed). detail may be empty; claim is required; parent may be empty (a top-level item).\n\nInputs:\n- `claim` (*string*): \n- `detail` (*string*): \n- `parent` (*string*): \n- `nn_sessionid` (*string*): ","import":"","params":[{"name":"claim","type":"String"},{"name":"detail","type":"String"},{"name":"parent","type":"String"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"uyunpg1a03a5137c3yc","readers":[],"time":1792853081753,"username":"system","writers":[]}